reachable types that may hold a module record (`NxSites.reachBad_fixed`) added. `tsigFixed`
lists the parameter types of the reachable definitions, the result types of the generic ones,
and the parameter and conclusion types of the reachable relations.

Both were printed by a throwaway program from `specs/spectec/wasm-3.0.ast` and are not trusted:
the kernel checks every entry against the fixed script (`NxSites.itemOk sigX`,
`NxTyped.tsigDefOk`, `NxTyped.tsigRelOk`, in `Check00`-`Check19`).
-/

